=\"ob-is-breaking-bad elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-035d7f5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"035d7f5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ob_bbad_use_it&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;_ob_bbad_sssic_use&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_glider_is_slider&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6266cef\" data-id=\"6266cef\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ob_bbad_is_stalker&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_teleporter_use&quot;:false,&quot;_ob_column_hoveranimator&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_column_has_pseudo&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1955df7 ob-harakiri-inherit ob-has-background-overlay elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1955df7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ob_use_harakiri&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;_ob_harakiri_writing_mode&quot;:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;_ob_postman_use&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_perspektive_use&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_poopart_use&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;_ob_shadough_use&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_allow_hoveranimator&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_widget_stalker_use&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"188\">Valentine\u2019s Day Under the Stars at The Quicken Tree<\/h2><p data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"474\">Valentine\u2019s Day is the perfect excuse to slow down, dress up, and spend quality time with the one you love \u2014 and this year, <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"334\">The Quicken Tree<\/strong> invites you to celebrate in truly romantic style with <strong data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"424\">Valentine\u2019s Day Under the Stars<\/strong>, taking place on <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"473\">Saturday 14th February 2026<\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"802\">Set in the beautiful countryside near Fillongley, The Quicken Tree provides the ultimate setting for an unforgettable evening. From the moment you arrive, romance is in the air. You\u2019ll be welcomed with a <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"716\">sparkling glass of Pink Prosecco<\/strong>, setting the tone for a night of indulgence, connection, and exceptional hospitality.<\/p><p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"1185\">Your Valentine\u2019s experience includes a <strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"874\">luxurious three-course meal<\/strong>, thoughtfully prepared and beautifully presented by our talented kitchen team. Expect delicious flavours, elegant dishes, and a relaxed yet refined atmosphere designed to help you savour every moment together. Whether you\u2019re celebrating a long-standing love or a new chapter, this is a night made for memories.<\/p><p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1532\">For those who want to make the evening even more special, <strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1271\">upgrades are available<\/strong>, allowing you to turn Valentine\u2019s Day into a romantic getaway. Stay overnight in one of our <strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1426\">beautiful bedrooms, luxury pods, or charming shepherd huts<\/strong>, as featured on <em data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1465\">Hotel Inspector 2025<\/em>. Wake up refreshed and extend the magic beyond the evening itself.<\/p><p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1670\">Valentine\u2019s Day Under the Stars is priced at <strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1597\">\u00a350 per person<\/strong>.<br data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1601\" \/><strong data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1640\">Booking and pre-order are essential<\/strong>, and availability is limited.<\/p><p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1797\">To secure your table, please <strong data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1722\">call 01676 543300<\/strong>.<br data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1726\" \/>For menu details and further information, visit <strong data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1796\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http:\/\/www.quickentree.uk\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1794\">www.quickentree.uk<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1977\">This Valentine\u2019s Day, treat your loved one to something truly special \u2014 beautiful food, a romantic atmosphere, and an evening designed to be remembered long after the stars fade.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Valentine&#8217;s Under the Stars Valentine\u2019s Day Under the Stars at The Quicken Tree Valentine\u2019s Day is the perfect excuse to slow down, dress up, and spend quality time with the one you love \u2014 and this year, The Quicken Tree invites you to celebrate in truly romantic style with Valentine\u2019s Day Under the Stars, taking [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":7821},{"date":"2024-01-02T13:19:18","slug":"a-heartwarming-christmas-day-at-the-quicken-tree","link":"https:\/\/quickentree.uk\/a-heartwarming-christmas-day-at-the-quicken-tree\/","title":{"rendered":"A Heartwarming Christmas Day at The Quicken Tree:"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4652\" class=\"elementor elementor-4652\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"ob-is-breaking-bad elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6d441bb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ele