quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Your heartwarming feedback fills us with immense gratitude and fuels our passion for creating unforgettable experiences. To everyone who celebrated with us, thank you for choosing The Quicken Tree for your Christmas Day celebration. We eagerly look forward to more magical moments together in 2024. \ud83e\udd42<\/p><p><strong>Lucy &#8211; Restaurant Manager.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Previous slide Next slide The Quicken Tree came alive with joy and laughter on Christmas Day making it an unforgettable celebration, a true testament to the festive season&#8217;s spirit\u2014and a cracker of a Christmas! Our incredible team at The Quicken Tree poured their hearts into making this day an absolute success. Their dedication, meticulous attention, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":4655},{"date":"2022-12-12T14:20:55","slug":"all-new-quicken-tree","link":"https:\/\/quickentree.uk\/all-new-quicken-tree\/","title":{"rendered":"Welcome to the All New Quicken Tree"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1\" class=\"elementor elementor-1\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"ob-is-breaking-bad elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-133323ed elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"133323ed\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ob_bbad_use_it&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;_ob_bbad_sssic_use&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;_ob_glider_is_slider&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elem